# the worked example for the debugger.
#
# each of the four ear/head states the trace renders, in one paddock:
#
#   ^ ears forward   head ~0.2 ^   attending, head relaxed  -> every frame sharp
#   _ ears back _                 agonistic (EAD103)        -> the trace retreats
#   ^ ears forward   head ~0.8 ^   attending, head high     -> frames float
#   ^ ears divided   head ~-0.3 _   divided attention       -> the fork splits
#
# the same snort keeps being emitted, and the animal attends to it differently
# each time. the signal is one thing; what the horse does with it is another.
#
# run it in the playground and watch the trace: echoed (sharp), unanswered
# "not attending" (blurred, retreated), echoed again (sharp, floating), and
# under a divided posture with no handler answering that side, a fork with
# two silences: the left eye reads novelty, the right eye reads category, and
# neither side is listening for a snort.
#
# the debugger cites: Wathan & McComb 2014 (ears are attention), Wathan et al.
# 2015 EquiFACS (EAD103, ears independent), Lewis et al. 2025 (agonistic
# context), and GRAMMAR.md 4/12g for the laterality of the fork.

@ trail  8  left bias

band trace

    # hear everything first; the context wraps the rest of the band, so the
    # lead mare's signals land in it (GRAMMAR.md 8).
    context field
        hears snort
            ^ ears forward   nostrils AD38   tension ~0.1 ^
            release 1

    lead mare show
        # 1 - attending. answered, sharp, head ~0.2.
        ^ ears forward   head ~0.2 ^
        snort

        # 2 - both ears flattened. agonistic. not attending.
        # the handler exists but the horse is not there for it.
        _ ears back _
        snort

        # 3 - attending again, head high: frames float.
        ^ ears forward   head ~0.8 ^
        snort

        # 4 - one ear forward, one back: divided attention.
        # the trace forks: left eye reads novelty, right eye reads category.
        # the handler is still there, but the horse is only half there.
        ^ ears divided   head ~-0.3 _
        snort
        release